    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:0",
      "text": "On 14 February 2025, Northstar Systems Ltd. (“Northstar”), a Bengaluru-based enterprise software company, signed a definitive agreement to acquire Meridian Analytics Pvt. Ltd. (“Meridian”), a Pune-based data analytics provider."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:1",
      "text": "The transaction valued Meridian at approximately n420 crore on a cash-free, debt-free basis."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:2",
      "text": "Northstar said the acquisition would strengthen its cloud analytics business and expand its presence in the Indian banking and insurance sectors."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:3",
      "text": "Northstar’s Chief Executive Officer, Ananya Rao, led the negotiations with Meridian’s founder and CEO, Rohan Mehta."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:4",
      "text": "Rao described Meridian as “a strong fit for our regulated-industry strategy.”"
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:5",
      "text": "Mehta will remain with the combined business for at least 18 months as President of Financial Services Analytics."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:6",
      "text": "He will report to Rao after closing."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:7",
      "text": "The agreement provides for an upfront cash payment of n300 crore and an earn-out of up to n120 crore, subject to Meridian achieving revenue and customer-retention targets during FY2026 and FY2027."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:8",
      "text": "The earn-out will be paid to Meridian’s selling shareholders, including founder Rohan Mehta and venture investor Cedar Peak Ventures LLP."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:9",
      "text": "Meridian was founded in 2016 by Rohan Mehta and Kavya Iyer."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:10",
      "text": "Cedar Peak Ventures invested n55 crore in a Series B round in 2021 and owns 22% of Meridian immediately before the transaction."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:11",
      "text": "Mehta owns 51%, Iyer owns 17%, and employees and other early investors collectively own the remaining 10%."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:12",
      "text": "Northstar is listed on the National Stock Exchange of India under the ticker NSTAR."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:13",
      "text": "Its largest institutional shareholder is Horizon Mutual Fund, which holds 8.4% of its outstanding shares."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:14",
      "text": "Northstar’s board approved the acquisition unanimously on 12 February 2025."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:15",
      "text": "The board’s approval followed a recommendation from its Strategy and Investment Committee, chaired by independent director Devika Shah."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:16",
      "text": "Axis Capital acted as the exclusive financial adviser to Northstar."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:17",
      "text": "K&A; Legal Partners advised Northstar on legal matters, while Desai Rao Associates represented Meridian."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:18",
      "text": "Grant Thornton Bharat conducted financial due diligence, and Veritas Cyber Risk performed a cybersecurity assessment of Meridian’s systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:19",
      "text": "Northstar expects to fund the upfront consideration through n180 crore of internal cash and a n120 crore acquisition loan from Union National Bank."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:20",
      "text": "The loan carries a floating interest rate linked to the bank’s one-year benchmark and has a three-year maturity."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:21",
      "text": "Northstar’s Chief Financial Officer, Sameer Kulkarni, stated that the company expects the transaction to remain within its leverage policy."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:22",
      "text": "Meridian provides predictive analytics software used by 38 banks and 14 insurance companies."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:23",
      "text": "Its flagship platform, Meridian Insight, helps financial institutions detect suspicious transactions, estimate credit risk, and forecast customer churn."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:24",
      "text": "Northstar currently sells cloud infrastructure and workflow automation products to many of the same institutions but does not own a dedicated financial-services analytics platform."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:25",
      "text": "The companies expect to cross-sell Meridian Insight to Northstar’s existing 110 banking and insurance customers."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:26",
      "text": "Northstar also plans to integrate Meridian Insight with its cloud platform, Northstar CloudOne."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:27",
      "text": "The integration is expected to take 12 months and will be overseen by Northstar Chief Technology Officer Priya Nair and Meridian’s engineering head, Arjun Deshpande."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:28",
      "text": "Nair will chair a joint Integration Management Office (IMO), while Deshpande will lead the product migration workstream."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:29",
      "text": "The IMO has identified three priorities: migrating customer workloads without service interruption, consolidating duplicate vendor contracts, and aligning data-governance controls."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:30",
      "text": "Meridian currently operates two data centres in Pune and one disaster-recovery site in Hyderabad."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:31",
      "text": "Northstar intends to retain the Pune facilities for at least two years and move selected workloads to CloudOne after regulatory review."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:32",
      "text": "Completion is conditional on approval from the Competition Commission of India (CCI), consent from certain Meridian lenders, and the absence of a material adverse change."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:33",
      "text": "The parties submitted their initial CCI filing on 3 March 2025."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:34",
      "text": "The regulator requested additional market-share information on 21 March."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:35",
      "text": "Northstar and Meridian submitted the requested data on 4 April."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:36",
      "text": "The parties initially expected closing by 30 June 2025."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:37",
      "text": "However, the extended regulatory review could move completion into July."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:38",
      "text": "Until closing, both companies must operate independently and comply with the interim operating covenants in the agreement."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:39",
      "text": "Neither party may make certain material acquisitions, dispose of specified assets, or amend key customer contracts without the other party’s consent."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:40",
      "text": "The transaction does not include Meridian’s small consumer mobile-app division, DataPocket."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:41",
      "text": "That business will be transferred to a newly formed entity, Pocket Labs Pvt. Ltd., before completion."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:42",
      "text": "Meridian’s shareholders will own 70% of Pocket Labs, while its current product director, Neel Shah, will own 30% and serve as its CEO."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:43",
      "text": "The principal execution risks are customer attrition, employee departures, technology integration delays, and regulatory restrictions on combining certain datasets."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:44",
      "text": "Cedar Peak Ventures has requested monthly reporting on customer retention until the earn-out period ends."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:45",
      "text": "Northstar has agreed to provide a quarterly integration report to Meridian’s former shareholders."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:46",
      "text": "Some Meridian customers are concerned about whether their data will be transferred to Northstar systems."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:47",
      "text": "The companies have stated that customer data will remain subject to existing contracts and applicable Indian data-protection requirements."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:48",
      "text": "No customer-level migration will occur until the relevant approvals and technical safeguards are in place."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:49",
      "text": "After closing, Meridian will operate as a wholly owned subsidiary of Northstar Systems Ltd. for an initial integration period."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:50",
      "text": "Its legal entity will remain active while the companies evaluate whether to merge selected support and administrative functions."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:51",
      "text": "Northstar will appoint two directors to Meridian’s board."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:52",
      "text": "Rohan Mehta will hold one board seat for 18 months, subject to the shareholders’ agreement and applicable law."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:53",
      "text": "The earn-out is linked to two performance measures."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:54",
      "text": "First, Meridian must achieve cumulative revenue of at least n160 crore across FY2026 and FY2027."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:55",
      "text": "Second, at least 90% of its top 30 customers by annual contract value must renew during the measurement period."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:56",
      "text": "If both targets are met, the full n120 crore earn-out will be payable."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:57",
      "text": "A partial payment may be made if revenue reaches 90% of target and customer retention remains above 85%."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:58",
      "text": "Northstar’s finance team will calculate the earn-out using audited financial statements prepared under the accounting policies specified in the acquisition agreement."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:59",
      "text": "Any dispute will first be referred to the chief financial officers of both parties."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:60",
      "text": "If they cannot resolve it within 20 business days, an independent accounting expert jointly appointed by the parties will determine the disputed amount."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:61",
      "text": "This document is entirely fictional and was created solely to test document-to-knowledge-graph extraction."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:62",
      "text": "All companies, people, transaction terms, dates, and figures are synthetic."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:63",
      "text": "Similarities to real entities or transactions are coincidental."
    },
    {
      "id": "e94fb7b9ed9a41f2a4f74b511e47fdf2c2b126ddf255f71c8d32f491533c0234:64",
      "text": "Suggested extraction targets: PERSON, ORGANIZATION, LOCATION, DATE, MONEY, PRODUCT, REGULATOR, OWNERSHIP, ACQUISITION, ADVISER_TO, FOUNDED_BY, INVESTED_IN, REPORTS_TO, FINANCED_BY, SUBSIDIARY_OF, APPROVED_BY, and CONDITIONAL_ON."
    }
  ]
}